in nethack (v3.0) it's a "wide sword named Stormbringer".  you could,
of course, wish for it (a waste of a good wish).  if you're chaotic
(and diligent and patient) you can obtain it as a reward for faithful
devotion to your god (#offer corpses at an altar).  there's also a
chance that you (chaotically) could receive it during the course of a
prayer.  it occurs naturally in other ways but the above are ways you
can influence its existence.  it should exist uniquely in any "current"
dungeon (let's say everyone is playing pl8 or pl9 now).

